From: =?UTF-8?q?Arda=20Ye=C5=9Fil?= <aryesil04@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 07:38:05 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat(tezuka): opt-in TX complex 8-bit (cs8) mode for libre

cs8_12_demux expands {Q8,I8} words into 16-bit I/Q in front of the TX
interpolator; an axi_ad9361 patch forces the Q0 channel to the DMA source when
only I0 is enabled. Enabled at build time with CS8TX=1. Untested on hardware.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
